                            </div>

                            <div class="flex-grow-1 small">
                                All interactions are at your own risk. celoscan is not responsible for any losses or damages resulting from use of this feature.
                            </div>
                        </li>

                        <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center py-3">
                            <div class="me-3">
                                <span class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center bg-light text-dark rounded-circle fs-4" style="width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem;">🧠</span>
